# Manual examples only. POST can create paid/quota-limited provider work when enabled.
# Current local config pauses new generation until the operator verifies quota.
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7239
@poiId = 1
@jobId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Frontend proximity configuration (read-only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content-preparations/settings

### Prepare only source-language audio of nearby Published POIs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pois/prepare-nearby
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 10.7798,
  "longitude": 106.6990
}

### Explicitly request exactly one language; use codes from GET /api/languages
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pois/{{poiId}}/prepare-content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "en"
}

### Replace jobId with a jobId returned by a POST (no JWT required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content-preparations/{{jobId}}

### Read stored content only (does not enqueue)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pois/{{poiId}}/content?language=en

### Expected 400, never generates
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pois/{{poiId}}/prepare-content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "unknown"
}
